# Player and admin login.
::case login.player  A player connects and lands in their location
::login alice Alice alicepass
think [name(%#)]
think [loc(%#)]
look
::case login.admin  A wizard connects
::login wiz Wiz wizpass
think [name(%#)] [hasflag(%#,WIZARD)]
::case login.god  God connects
::login god One godpass
think [name(%#)] [hasflag(%#,WIZARD)] [hasflag(%#,ROYALTY)]
::case login.badpassword  A wrong password is refused
::login-fail bad Alice wrong
::case login.unknown  An unknown player is refused
::login-fail nobody Nobody whatever
